# 容器内运行的脚本必须保持 LF：CRLF 会让 proot 容器里的 bash/python 报错（上游 issue #45）
* text=auto eol=lf
*.so binary
*.bin binary
*.jar binary
*.aar binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.zip binary
*.apk binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.js text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.c text eol=lf
*.h text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.gradle text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.aidl text eol=lf
# 退休原件必须覆盖后面的按扩展名规则，Git 不得改写原始换行字节。
tools/history/** -text -eol

